source=\"bestiarylevel\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Difficulty</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Easy\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"12\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bestiary_Level_Easy_76d062.gif\" width=\"57\"/></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occurrence\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occurrence</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Common\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"12\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bestiary_Occurrence_Common_bbcd9e.gif\" width=\"46\"/></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occurrence\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Charm Points</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">15 <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Charm Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"12\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Charm_Icon_d968ed.gif\" width=\"11\"/></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occurrence\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Kills to Unlock</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">500</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"attacktype\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Behaviour</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span title=\"Creature attacks in melee range\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Logout Block Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Logout_Block_Icon_8f2784.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span> <span title=\"Creature casts spells or uses skills\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Magic Level Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Magic_Level_Icon_d4433d.png\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"bestiarylevel\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Soul Core</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Orc Rider Soul Core\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Orc_Rider_Soul_Core_e260b8.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Immunity Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"paraimmune\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Paralysable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"senseinvis\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sense Invis</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Behavioural Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walksaround\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Walks Around</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Energy Field (Square)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"19\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Energy_Field_Square_8987b7.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Energy<br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Fire\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_0ff2ec.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Fire<br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poison Gas\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poison_Gas_c58dd6.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Poison</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">August 28, 2002<br/>Summer Update 2002</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">Creatures</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-item-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20240228095607&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Orc_Rider_8192c1.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"creature-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see an orc rider.</div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Orc arga Huummmak!</li><li>Grrrrrrr</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<div class=\"webdesc\"><blockquote class=\"webdesc-text\"><p>Orc Riders are orcish elite troops mounted on grim war wolves. Their fearsome steeds make them fast and agile while their heavy lances can deal impressive damage. Orc Rider patrols can mostly be found in the plains of Tibia where the terrain is ideal for mounted combat. It is very difficult to run away from a pack of Orc Riders once you have had the misfortune to meet them.</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"webdesc-from\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 2em 0 0;\">—Tibia Library</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>These mounted orcs are strong but can be tricked with <a href=\"#/wiki/Invisibility\">Invisibility</a>. They don't drop <a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf%20Paw\">Wolf Paws</a>. Orcish Axes can be looted easily and sold for a good price to NPCs.<br/>Orc Riders also drop <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Tusk\">Orc Tusks</a> during raids of the <a href=\"#/quest/machinery-of-war-quest\">Machinery of War Quest</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-abilities\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Abilities\">Abilities</span></h3>\n<div class=\"ability_list\"><div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> Melee</span> (0-130)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Hasted\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Haste_Icon_105a69.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Haste\">Haste</a></span></div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-creature-resistance-table\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Damage_Taken_From_Elements\">Damage Taken From Elements</span></h3>\n<div id=\"w-creature-resistance-d\">\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Physical\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Physical <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Bestiary Physical Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bestiary_Physical_Icon_Big_83da43.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:90.9091%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 9.0909%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.1000\" title=\"Death\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Death <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Cursed Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cursed_Icon_Big_de8a1f.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#27c429; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">110%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.9000\" title=\"Holy\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Holy <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Dazzled Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dazzled_Icon_Big_546495.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:81.8182%; background-color:#d0bd56; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 18.1818%); display:inline-block;\">90%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Ice\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Ice <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Freezing Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Freezing_Icon_Big_4dcec8.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:90.9091%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 9.0909%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Fire\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Fire <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Burning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Burning_Icon_Big_a56686.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:90.9091%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 9.0909%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.8000\" title=\"Energy\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Energy <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Electrified Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Electrified_Icon_Big_b60abe.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:72.7273%; background-color:#d0bd56; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 27.2727%); display:inline-block;\">80%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.1000\" title=\"Earth\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Earth <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poisoned Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_Big_f04eb1.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#27c429; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">110%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Drown\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Drown <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Drowning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_Big_f65e47.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:90.9091%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 9.0909%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:90.9091%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 9.0909%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Ulderek%27s%20Rock\">Orc Fort</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Peninsula\">Orc Peninsula</a>, near <a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Cathedral\">Dark Cathedral</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao%20Orc%20Land\">Zao Orc Land</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tOrc Riders fight to the death.<br/><br/>An orc rider attacks in melee range.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tIf you are a Mage, use <a href=\"#/wiki/Invisible\">Invisible</a> and runes, Stoneshower or <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Fireball\">GFB</a> are useful because Orc Riders are usually found in groups. Premium mages should try to use Terra Strike to minimise waste.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Although the sprites for orc rider were implemented on Update 7.0, the first known spawns of this creature were probably only implemented with the <a href=\"#/wiki/Ulderek%27s%20Rock\">Ulderek's Rock</a> revamp on Update 7.2.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 22,120 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Gold Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" 